B.Nq=new A.lD("jumlatech","Jumlatech","Jumlatech is a commercial service designed for retail store owners, enabling them to access the key products they need.",B.IZ,B.Je,"assets/projects/jumlatech/jumla-zone.jpg","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.tms.jumlatech&hl=en",null,"Jumlatech is a commercial service designed for retail store owners, enabling them to access the key products they need.\n\nRetailers can browse categories and brands, search inventory, apply discounts, manage cart quantities by piece or carton, and order wholesale goods through Jumla Zone \u2014 a bilingual Arabic experience built for Syrian retail.","2024")
