B.Nr=new A.lD("maalpay","Maal Pay","Maal Pay is more than a wallet \u2014 it's a movement. Born in Syria, built by Syrian talent, and designed for the future, Maal Pay connects the local economy to the world with transfers, USDT access, scan & pay, and real-time currency conversion.",B.GO,B.Jg,"assets/projects/maalpay/branding.png",null,null,"Maal Pay is more than a wallet \u2014 it's a movement. Born in Syria, built by Syrian talent, and designed for the future, Maal Pay connects our local economy to the world.\n\nFrom international transfers to crypto access, Maal Pay makes it possible for Syrians to move money with freedom, speed, and control \u2014 despite decades of isolation.\n\nWhat You Can Do with Maal Pay:\n\u2022 Send & receive money instantly \u2014 across Syria or across borders\n\u2022 Access USDT and future crypto tools, even without a bank account\n\u2022 Scan & pay in shops, restaurants, and more\n\u2022 Convert between SYP and global currencies with real-time rates\n\u2022 Play to Earn with Referrals \u2014 scratch cards, streaks, and USDT rewards\n\u2022 Track every transaction with full clarity\n\nData Secure. Wallet Protected. 100% Syrian.\nMaal Pay works even when global apps don\u2019t. And we\u2019re just getting started.\n\nWelcome to the new era of money \u2014 faster, freer, and truly local.\n\nNote: Currently temporarily unavailable on app stores.","2025")
